{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24510","headline":"谈氏外孙生三日喜是男偶吟成篇兼戏呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"谈氏外孙生三日喜是男偶吟成篇兼戏呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉芽珠颗小男儿，罗荐兰汤欲罢时。\n芣苢春来盈女手，梧桐老去长孙枝。\n庆传媒氏燕先贺，喜报谈家乌预知。\n明日贫翁具鸡黍，应须酬赛引雏诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}